# FINTECH 545 – Quantitative Risk Management

## Overview

This repository contains my work for FINTECH 545: Quantitative Risk Management.

The project focuses on implementing and testing quantitative risk management techniques using Python, including covariance and correlation estimation, positive semi-definite matrix adjustments, simulation methods, return calculations, and statistical distribution fitting.

